DrLogic (Surprise): Before you go breeder, stay cautious. There are miscreants around here. There are people with no moral compass or grasp on right or wrong!
DrLogic (Normal): People you wouldn't believe live among us...
- Like you?
	DrLogic (Happy): Very funny. A man such as myself will be remembered till the end of time for my undying loyalty to ethics and justice.
	Anon: ...
	DrLogic (Normal): All i'm saying is to watch out. People around here are insane. But at least me and you have a good head on our shoulders.
- Like who?
	DrLogic: Dr. Insane-O Mode. My younger brother. He is an evil man with insane ideas. He believes in yip rights! Hah! Thats like giving germs respect.
	Anon: Why is that insane?
	DrLogic: Yips can't feel pain. Despite Tardigates best efforts yips are merely slime injections molded into shapes.
	DrLogic: I still enjoy breeding my yips and seeing what they do. Its the only thing to do in this blasted world, you know that better than me.
	Anon: You have a point.